OldIron builds on llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp), MIT licensed,
pinned at commit 2744e48d1 (build 816, 0.7.0-dev). The engine is not redistributed here;
clone that commit and apply the build described in README.md.

GGUF quantisation formats come from ggml/llama.cpp, MIT licensed.

Weights are not redistributed: Qwen3.6-35B-A3B and gpt-oss-20b are third-party downloads
under their own terms.
